# A grid of pipes; S is on one big loop.
# Part 1: the number of steps along the loop to the point farthest from S.
# Part 2: the number of tiles enclosed by the loop.

example """
-L|F7
7S-7|
L|7||
-L-J|
L|-JF
"""
  part1 = 4

